        "content_writing": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The maps below show the future plan about the Biology School in a particular university. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
