            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FB1HdsLX8oOX9NxnSOPlL5bbgJh\">Overall, while some key facilities remain in their original positions, significant modifications are planned, including the addition of new academic buildings and administrative spaces. The most notable changes include a reduction in green spaces and the introduction of new educational facilities.</div>\n</div>",
