            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AyV1dWCBToaJ6Mxrwmfli6xzgmb\">At the top of the current map, there is a cluster of trees leading to an indoor sports hall on the right side. In the future plan, while the indoor sports hall remains, most trees will be removed to accommodate new lab and office spaces, indicating a shift toward more academic functionality in this area.</div>\n</div>",
