            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QYuMdGJHOoMNWxxSQXSlDCaYgKh\">Moving toward the bottom, the present layout shows a central library and drama centre in the middle, with two teaching buildings and various facilities including a cafe, lecture room, and IT centre surrounding them. The future plan reveals substantial changes to this area: the drama centre will be replaced by a music centre, an additional teaching building and lecture room will be constructed, and the IT centre will be expanded and relocated further south. Furthermore, a new staff car park will be added to the lower left section, displacing the currently wooded corner.</div>\n</div>",
